<title>SOUTH KOREA: SOCCER-SOUTH KOREA AND THAILAND DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH KOREA AND THAILAND DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea and Thailand drew 0-0</p>
<p>in their World Cup Asian zone group six qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>    Final standings	P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> South Korea		 4   3   1   0   9   1  10</p>
<p> Thailand		    4   1   1   2   5   6   4</p>
<p> Hong Kong		   4   1   0   3   3  10   3</p>
<p>South Korea qualify for second round.</p>
</text>
